#: ../main_window.rst:43
msgid "Play-head / Ruler"
msgstr ""

#: ../main_window.rst:43
msgid "The ruler shows the time-scale, and the line is the play-head. The play-head represents the current playback position. The current timecode can be clicked to enter an exact timecode. Hold :kbd:`Shift` key while dragging the playhead to snap to nearby clips."
msgstr ""

